<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<model version="NetLogo 7.0.4" snapToGrid="true">
  <code><![CDATA[__includes ["netlogo-bubble.nls"]]]></code>
  <widgets>
    <view x="305" wrappingAllowedX="false" y="10" frameRate="30.0" minPycor="-1" height="235" showTickCounter="true" patchSize="44.0" fontSize="12" wrappingAllowedY="false" width="560" tickCounterLabel="ticks" maxPycor="1" updateMode="1" maxPxcor="11" minPxcor="0"></view>
    <button x="10" y="10" height="40" disableUntilTicks="false" forever="false" kind="Observer" width="85" display="Setup">setup</button>
    <button x="100" y="10" height="40" disableUntilTicks="true" forever="false" kind="Observer" width="85" display="Step">step-once</button>
    <button x="190" y="10" height="40" disableUntilTicks="true" forever="true" kind="Observer" width="85" display="Go">go</button>
    <slider x="10" step="1" y="58" max="9999" width="265" display="seed-number" height="42" min="0" direction="Horizontal" default="42" variable="seed-number"></slider>
    <chooser x="10" y="105" height="55" variable="activation-order" current="1" width="265" display="activation-order">
      <choice type="string" value="index"></choice>
      <choice type="string" value="shuffled"></choice>
    </chooser>
    <slider x="10" step="10" y="165" max="1000" width="265" display="max-ticks" height="42" min="10" direction="Horizontal" default="300" variable="max-ticks"></slider>

    <button x="10" y="225" height="40" disableUntilTicks="true" forever="false" kind="Observer" width="85" display="Perturb">perturb</button>
    <slider x="100" step="0.05" y="220" max="0.5" width="175" display="perturb-fraction" height="45" min="0.05" direction="Horizontal" default="0.25" variable="perturb-fraction"></slider>
    <slider x="10" step="1" y="270" max="9999" width="265" display="intervention-seed" height="42" min="0" direction="Horizontal" default="91" variable="intervention-seed"></slider>

    <button x="10" y="325" height="40" disableUntilTicks="true" forever="false" kind="Observer" width="85" display="Freeze">freeze-selected</button>
    <button x="100" y="325" height="40" disableUntilTicks="true" forever="false" kind="Observer" width="85" display="Unfreeze">clear-freezes</button>
    <slider x="10" step="1" y="370" max="6" width="265" display="freeze-count" height="42" min="0" direction="Horizontal" default="2" variable="freeze-count"></slider>
    <chooser x="10" y="417" height="55" variable="freeze-mode-choice" current="0" width="265" display="freeze-mode-choice">
      <choice type="string" value="moveable"></choice>
      <choice type="string" value="immovable"></choice>
    </chooser>
    <button x="10" y="482" height="40" disableUntilTicks="true" forever="false" kind="Observer" width="265" display="Export trajectory CSV">export-trajectory "netlogo-bubble-trajectory.csv"</button>

    <monitor x="305" precision="0" y="255" height="50" fontSize="12" width="135" display="boundary length">boundary-length</monitor>
    <monitor x="445" precision="0" y="255" height="50" fontSize="12" width="100" display="sorted?">sorted?</monitor>
    <monitor x="550" precision="0" y="255" height="50" fontSize="12" width="120" display="quiescent?">quiescent?</monitor>
    <monitor x="675" precision="0" y="255" height="50" fontSize="12" width="90" display="swaps">swap-count</monitor>
    <monitor x="770" precision="0" y="255" height="50" fontSize="12" width="95" display="event">last-event</monitor>

    <plot x="305" autoPlotX="true" yMax="11.0" autoPlotY="false" yAxis="descending pairs" y="315" xMin="0.0" height="207" legend="false" xMax="100.0" yMin="0.0" width="560" xAxis="tick" display="Boundary length">
      <setup>clear-plot</setup>
      <update></update>
      <pen interval="1.0" mode="0" display="boundary length" color="-13345367" legend="false">
        <setup></setup>
        <update>plot boundary-length</update>
      </pen>
    </plot>
    <note x="305" y="530" backgroundDark="0" fontSize="11" width="560" markdown="true" height="66" textColorDark="-1" textColorLight="-16777216" backgroundLight="0">**Reading the line:** color encodes value; the top number is the value and `#` is persistent cell identity. Yellow backing = moveable freeze. Red backing = immovable freeze.</note>
  </widgets>
  <info><![CDATA[## WHAT IS IT?

A deliberately small visual calibration of the validated Python bubble-sorting experiment. Twelve persistent cells apply a local bubble rule: each active cell looks left or right with equal probability, then swaps left when smaller or right when larger.

This is an exploratory NetLogo spike, not a replacement for Experiment 001.

## HOW TO USE IT

1. Select a seed and activation order.
2. Press **Setup**, then **Step** or **Go**.
3. Press **Perturb** to exchange two contiguous blocks.
4. Select a freeze mode and press **Freeze**. A moveable frozen cell cannot act but a neighbor can carry it. An immovable frozen cell also blocks neighbor swaps.
5. Use **Export trajectory CSV** to save every recorded setup, intervention, and tick as a flat table.

Blue color encodes value. Labels show `value` and persistent `#cell-id`. Yellow patch backing marks moveable freezing; red marks immovable freezing. Boundary length counts adjacent descending pairs, exactly as in the Python calibration.

## REPRODUCIBILITY

`seed-number` owns transition randomness. `intervention-seed` is applied inside `with-local-randomness`, so choosing a block or frozen cells does not consume the transition random stream. Same NetLogo version, parameters, and seeds reproduce a run.

The `index` schedule activates identities in current positional order. The `shuffled` schedule shuffles persistent identities once per tick. Every identity is offered exactly one activation per tick.

## BEHAVIORSPACE

Four embedded experiments cover baseline sorting, recovery from a block swap after sorting, and matched moveable/immovable freeze cases. Metrics are recorded every step and can be exported from BehaviorSpace as CSV.

## LIMITS

NetLogo and Python use different random-number generators, so the calibration targets rule and outcome parity rather than byte-identical cross-engine paths. The Python implementation remains authoritative for completed experiments.]]></info>
  <turtleShapes>
    <shape name="default" rotatable="true" editableColorIndex="0">
      <polygon color="-1920102913" filled="true" marked="true">
        <point x="150" y="5"></point><point x="40" y="250"></point><point x="150" y="205"></point><point x="260" y="250"></point>
      </polygon>
    </shape>
    <shape name="square" rotatable="false" editableColorIndex="0">
      <rectangle startX="30" startY="30" marked="true" color="-1920102913" endX="270" endY="270" filled="true"></rectangle>
    </shape>
  </turtleShapes>
  <linkShapes>
    <shape name="default" curviness="0.0">
      <lines><line x="0.0" visible="true"><dash value="1.0"></dash><dash value="0.0"></dash></line></lines>
      <indicator><shape name="link direction" rotatable="true" editableColorIndex="0"><line endX="90" startY="150" marked="true" color="-1920102913" endY="180" startX="150"></line><line endX="210" startY="150" marked="true" color="-1920102913" endY="180" startX="150"></line></shape></indicator>
    </shape>
  </linkShapes>
  <previewCommands>set seed-number 42
set activation-order "shuffled"
set max-ticks 300
set perturb-fraction 0.25
set intervention-seed 91
set freeze-count 2
set freeze-mode-choice "moveable"
setup
repeat 20 [ if not quiescent? [ step-once ] ]</previewCommands>
  <experiments>
    <experiment name="calibration-baseline" repetitions="3" sequentialRunOrder="true" runMetricsEveryStep="true" timeLimit="150">
      <setup>setup</setup><go>go</go>
      <metrics><metric>ticks</metric><metric>boundary-length</metric><metric>sorted?</metric><metric>quiescent?</metric><metric>values</metric><metric>cell-ids-by-position</metric><metric>freeze-modes-by-position</metric><metric>swap-count</metric><metric>comparison-count</metric><metric>last-event</metric></metrics>
      <constants>
        <enumeratedValueSet variable="seed-number"><value value="101"></value><value value="202"></value><value value="303"></value></enumeratedValueSet>
        <enumeratedValueSet variable="activation-order"><value value="&quot;index&quot;"></value><value value="&quot;shuffled&quot;"></value></enumeratedValueSet>
        <enumeratedValueSet variable="max-ticks"><value value="500"></value></enumeratedValueSet>
        <enumeratedValueSet variable="perturb-fraction"><value value="0.25"></value></enumeratedValueSet>
        <enumeratedValueSet variable="intervention-seed"><value value="91"></value></enumeratedValueSet>
        <enumeratedValueSet variable="freeze-count"><value value="2"></value></enumeratedValueSet>
        <enumeratedValueSet variable="freeze-mode-choice"><value value="&quot;moveable&quot;"></value></enumeratedValueSet>
      </constants>
    </experiment>
    <experiment name="calibration-block-swap" repetitions="1" sequentialRunOrder="true" runMetricsEveryStep="true" timeLimit="150">
      <setup>setup-block-swap</setup><go>go</go>
      <metrics><metric>ticks</metric><metric>boundary-length</metric><metric>sorted?</metric><metric>quiescent?</metric><metric>values</metric><metric>cell-ids-by-position</metric><metric>freeze-modes-by-position</metric><metric>swap-count</metric><metric>comparison-count</metric><metric>last-event</metric></metrics>
      <constants>
        <enumeratedValueSet variable="seed-number"><value value="101"></value><value value="202"></value><value value="303"></value></enumeratedValueSet>
        <enumeratedValueSet variable="activation-order"><value value="&quot;index&quot;"></value><value value="&quot;shuffled&quot;"></value></enumeratedValueSet>
        <enumeratedValueSet variable="max-ticks"><value value="500"></value></enumeratedValueSet>
        <enumeratedValueSet variable="perturb-fraction"><value value="0.25"></value></enumeratedValueSet>
        <enumeratedValueSet variable="intervention-seed"><value value="91"></value></enumeratedValueSet>
        <enumeratedValueSet variable="freeze-count"><value value="2"></value></enumeratedValueSet>
